WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.362 --> 00:00:04.126
- "Expect the arrival of
your first grandchild," what?

00:00:04.126 --> 00:00:07.839
- [Voiceover] Oh!
- What? What?

00:00:07.839 --> 00:00:11.569
(screaming and laughing)

00:00:11.569 --> 00:00:13.503
We're havin' a baby!

00:00:14.479 --> 00:00:16.630
- Look at this one. Oh!

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:18.302
Are you pregnant?
(all screaming)

00:00:18.302 --> 00:00:21.065
Oh my God! Oh my God!

00:00:21.065 --> 00:00:23.410
- (screaming and laughing)

00:00:23.410 --> 00:00:25.244
No kidding! Are you really?

00:00:25.244 --> 00:00:26.727
Are you really, are you really?

00:00:26.727 --> 00:00:28.170
Oh! (laughing)

00:00:28.170 --> 00:00:30.648
- Oh my God! Oh my God!

00:00:31.509 --> 00:00:33.777
- What the Hell is that?
(man laughing)

00:00:33.777 --> 00:00:36.401
Oh, I'm gonna be a grandma, man!

00:00:36.401 --> 00:00:38.688
(screaming)

00:00:38.688 --> 00:00:40.475
I'm gonna be a grandma!

00:00:41.114 --> 00:00:43.604
(sobbing)
(man giggling)

00:00:43.604 --> 00:00:45.591
- [Voiceover] That's
such a great reaction!

00:00:47.897 --> 00:00:50.739
- (shrieking) Oh, they're
gonna have a baby!

00:00:50.739 --> 00:00:53.290
- [Voiceover] They are?
(woman squealing)

00:00:53.290 --> 00:00:54.362
- [Voiceover] I'm pregnant.

00:00:54.362 --> 00:00:56.626
(screaming)

00:00:56.626 --> 00:01:00.002
- I just pooped in my pants.
(laughing from offscreen)

00:01:00.828 --> 00:01:01.768
(shriek)

00:01:01.768 --> 00:01:04.665
(all screaming)

00:01:05.710 --> 00:01:07.901
(woman laughing)

00:01:09.069 --> 00:01:11.953
- Congratulations, oh my God!

00:01:13.984 --> 00:01:17.080
- "World's best grandpa," oh what is it?

00:01:17.080 --> 00:01:18.665
- [Voiceover] "My grandma is the coolest."

00:01:18.665 --> 00:01:20.398
(woman laughing)
"I love my Aunt Katy."

00:01:20.398 --> 00:01:24.561
(piano and violin music)

